			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2024-11-01_2025-10-31" name="dei:SecurityExchangeName" id="c17a" format="ixt-sec:exchnameen">Nasdaq</ix:nonNumeric> Global Market</p>
